From 404a28e3f35a609601898b400b0ac714aeaa210c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diep Tran <trancaodiepnct@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:56:56 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(F11-F15): store redeem reasons and bill edit, admin
 refund queue, review moderation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- F11 (task 12): send the full qrPayload (format v1), reason-specific result panels (used at / store,
  wrong store with store list, expired, refund pending), OTP lock banner, BILL_REQUIRED keeps the code.
- F11 (task 14): redeem history shows campaign / bill, edit bill within 10 minutes.
- F12 (task 16): admin refund queue with two tabs - manual refunds (transaction code required /
  "không hoàn được") and payment mismatches.
- F15 (task 19): admin review moderation screen (hide with reason / unhide), brand list shows hidden badge.
- Tests: 113 (37 new).

Base: main (b08b91d).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
